  "passage": "Hi Alex, I hope you're well. Last weekend, my family and I went to the new recycling centre outside town. We took some old items to recycle, like bottles and paper. On the way, we had to cross at a busy crossing near the motorway. My little brother was anxious, but he behaved really well, holding my hand the whole time. At the centre, we saw a middle-aged man organising everything. He was very helpful and showed us how to separate materials for recycling. Afterwards, we visited a charity shop where I found a broken bookcase for only £5. I bought it to fix up for my room. I'm looking forward to our trip to London next month. Have you booked the tickets yet? Let me know so we can plan the details. Best wishes, Sam",
